            "review_title": "Review at THO - Wine space",
            "review_text": "Ha Phuong N\n2 contributions\n0\nA Quiet Corner for Wine Lovers Who Know What They’re Seeking\nOct 2025 • Friends\nTho Winespace has the kind of atmosphere that feels like a small, well-kept secret: warm, intimate, and effortlessly inviting. The owner truly understands wine—each explanation feels like a subtle map of aromas and textures, never flashy, just precise.\n\nThe food is a creative fusion of European and Asian influences, balanced and surprising in the best way. Every dish feels intentionally crafted to pair with the wines rather than simply accompany them.\n\nOverall: a place worth returning to when you want an evening with good conversation, thoughtful food, and wine explained by someone who genuinely knows its language. 🍷\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nWritten November 27, 2025",
            "rating": 5.0,
