            "review_title": "Review at THO - Wine space",
            "review_text": "Laura D\nLincolnshire9 contributions\n1\nWine!\nApr 2022\nLoved this place. I was actually there on a date but you could easily go with friends for a catch up. A wide selection of wines. The owner asked what I liked and brought me a different wine which wasn't on the menu. She has a vast knowledge of the wines she serves. Just loved this place. They also sell a small selection of food.\nValue\nService\nFood\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten August 8, 2022\nTrang N\nDear Laura, \nThank you for your kind and generous review. We had such a pleasure welcoming you to our Wine Space. We hope to see you again and present to you more of our wine selection.\nRead more\nWritten August 9, 2022\nThis response is the subjective opinion of the management representative and not of Tripadvisor LLC nor of its partners.",
